    "title": "Son accused of bludgeoning his 61-year-old mother to death with hammer inside home - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By JESSICA A. BOTELHO ,\n5 hours ago LAGUNA BEACH, Calif. (TNND) — A 36-year-old California man was accused of bludgeoning his mother to death with a hammer inside his home while she was visiting from Maine. The Orange County District Attorney's Office on Monday announced that Safford James Wolfson was charged with one felony count of murder and \"one felony enhancement of personally using a deadly weapon.\" Read full article",
